View ViewTableINVOICE 'Facture livraison (/*IDDELIVERY*/)' 'Facture livraison (/*IDDELIVERY*/)'  255 255 255 _ 0 0 0 0 5 5 5 5 '[TRACELEVEL=(/*TRACELEVEL*/);TRACEFILE=;TOOLBAR=0;FLIPVERTICALLY=0;FLIPHORIZONTALLY=0;NATURESCALE=0;BESTFIT=1;SCROLLBAR=1;SHOWNAME=1;ZOOMOBJECT=;CURRENTPAGE=1;CLOSEEVENT=0;BKGROUNDCOLOR=(255 255 255);SCREENCOLOR=(255 255 255);PATHLINEWIDTH=9;PATHLINECOLOR=(0 0 0);PATHARROWWIDTH=15;PATHARROWCOLOR=(255 0 0);POEMSERVER=;MAPLOGFILE=;MATRIXCRITERION=Distance;MATRIXCOMPUTERADIUS=0.5;SPEEDKMHOUR=50;STRAIGHTDISTANCERATIO=1.4;SITEINTRADISTANCE=;MATRIXMAXCOMPUTEWIDTH=;NEIGHBOURHOOD=;MATRIXFILENAME=;MATRIXDIRECTORY=;GLOBALVARIABLE=0]'

Table tableINVOICE _ _ 0 0 2000 500 \
"[]" - \
"[TITLE=Facture livraison (/*IDDELIVERY*/);FONTCOLOR=(0 0 0);FONTSIZE=10;FONTNAME=Times New Roman;LINESEPARATOR=\n;HEIGHT=30;BORDER=0;]"\
"[FONTCOLOR=(0 0 0);FONTSIZE=9;FONTNAME=Times New Roman;]" \
"[FONTCOLOR=(0 0 0);FONTSIZE=8;FONTNAME=Times New Roman;]" \
"[MARGIN=(10 0 10 0);FONTCOLOR=(0 0 0);FONTSIZE=9;FONTNAME=Times New Roman;] \
COLUMNFILL={(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255)};\
ALIGNTEXT={Left,Left,Left,Left,Left,Left,Center,Center,Center,Right,Right,Right}]"\
"[DATAOBJ=INVOICE;FILLCOLOR=LINERGB]"

Data INVOICE 'Facture livraison (/*IDDELIVERY*/)' INVOICE HTTPSQL 0 '[FIND={IDINVOICE,IDDELIVERY,IDCLIENT,NAMECLIENT,DISCOUNT,LABELDISCOUNT,DATEDELIVERY,DATEINVOICE,DATEPAYMENT,AMOUNTHT,TVA,AMOUNTVAT}]'   [DOUBLECLICK=] \
"[12;(string,IDINVOICE,No facture,,15,,);(string,IDDELIVERY,No livraison,,15,,);(string,IDCLIENT,ID client,,15,,);(string,NAMECLIENT,Nom client,,15,,);(string,DISCOUNT,Remise(%),,15,,);(string,LABELDISCOUNT,Libellé remise,,15,,);(date,DATEDELIVERY,Date livraison,,15,,YYYY-MM-DD|DD/MM/YYYY);(date,DATEINVOICE,Date facture,,15,,YYYY-MM-DD|DD/MM/YYYY);(date,DATEPAYMENT,Date paiement,,15,,YYYY-MM-DD|DD/MM/YYYY);(string,AMOUNTHT,Montant HT(€),,15,,);(string,TVA,TVA (%),,15,,);(string,AMOUNTVAT,TVA (€),,15,,);(string,AMOUNTTOTAL,TTC(€),,8.2.50,0);\
(string,WEIGHT,Poids,,8.2.50,0);\
(color,LINERGB,(255 255 255),,13.0.0);]" \
"SERVER=(/*SERVERIP*/);PORT=(/*SERVERPORT*/);QUERY=SELECT \
		  d.IdInvoice as IDINVOICE,\
		  d.id AS IDDELIVERY, d.idClient AS IDCLIENT, cl.Name as NAMECLIENT,\
		  d.RefInvoice as REFERENCE,\
		  format(d.Discount, '0.00') as DISCOUNT,\
		  d.LabelDiscount as LABELDISCOUNT,\
		  d.AmountHT as AMOUNTHT,\
		  format(d.VAT, '0.00') as TVA,\
		  d.AmountVAT as AMOUNTVAT,\
		  d.AmountTotal as AMOUNTTOTAL,\
		  d.DateDelivery as DATEDELIVERY,\
		  d.DateInvoice as DATEINVOICE,\
		  d.DatePayment as DATEPAYMENT,\
		  (select sum(a.Weight*ld.Quantity) from DELIVERY_PRODUCT ld inner join (/*DBOWNER*/)PRODUCT a on a.Id=ld.IdProduct where ld.IdDelivery=d.Id) as WEIGHT,\
		  '(255 255 255)' AS LINERGB \
	 FROM DELIVERY d, CLIENT cl \
	 WHERE d.IdClient=cl.Id\
	 AND d.id IN ((/*IDDELIVERY*/))\
	 ORDER BY d.Id,d.DateInvoice"


Script TableInvoiceProduct  'Détail facture' _ 28 'Détail facture' _ 'tableINVOICE' '( 0 0 0 0 )' _ _ _ '[COUNT=1;NETNCL=HTTP;SERVER=(/*SERVERIP*/);PORT=(/*SERVERPORT*/);TIMEOUT=86400000;MESSAGE=0;CANCEL=0;SKIP=0;WAITCURSOR=1;]'\
 Open '[DATAFMT=(SEP=COMMA,RET=COMMA,FMT=T,QUOT=SQUOT,HEADER=FALSE,COUNT=FALSE);FILE=(/*HTTPVIEW*/)TableInvoiceProduct.view]' _ _ \
"[POEMSERVER=(/*SERVERIP*/);SERVERPORT=(/*SERVERPORT*/);USERID=(/*USERID*/);CLUBID=(/*CLUBID*/);IDINVOICE={/*Selected(tableINVOICE;1;(string,IDINVOICE))*/};IDDELIVERY={/*Selected(tableINVOICE;1;(string,IDDELIVERY))*/}]"

Script PrintInvoice  'Imrpimer facture' _ 80 'Imrpimer facture' _ 'tableINVOICE' '( 0 0 0 0 )' _ _ _  '[COUNT=2;NETNCL=HTTP;SERVER=(/*SERVERIP*/);PORT=(/*SERVERPORT*/);MESSAGE=0;CANCEL=0;SKIP=0;WAITCURSOR=1;]' \
	 Ncl '(/*SERVERDIRECTORY*/)' '(/*SERVERDIRECTORY*/)Model\Script\ScriptPrint.n' '(/*SERVERDIRECTORY*/)ncl.cfg' _ _ _ 1 \
	 '(/*SERVERPORT*/) (/*USERID*/)  PrintInvoice.ini  Invoice \
	 {/*selected(tableINVOICE;1;(string,IDDELIVERY))*/}' \
	 WinExec "[WAITTIME=300S;CONSOLE=0;;DATAFMT=(SEP=',',RET=',',FMT=T,QUOT=SQUOT,HEADER=F,COUNT=F)]"\
	 'C:\Program Files (x86)\Microsoft\Edge\Application\msedge.exe' '(/*POEMPRINTAPPPATH*/)Invoice{/*selected(tableINVOICE;1;(string,IDDELIVERY))*/}.pdf' _ _ _ _ _ 

Script ModifyInvoice 'Modifier facture' _ 61 'Modifier facture' _ 'tableINVOICE' '( 0 0 0 0 )' '[0,(0 0 0),(255 255 255);;Arial,,-20;(C M),(2 2 2 2)]' _ _  '[SINGLESEL=1;RELOAD=1;TYPE=SQL;COUNT=2; COUNT=2;MESSAGE=1;CANCEL=0;WAITCURSOR=0;;DATAFMT=(SEP=COMMA,RET=COMMA,FMT=T,QUOT=SQUOT,HEADER=FALSE,COUNT=FALSE)]' \
'{/*Input(Modifier facture;4;\
(string,IDINVOICE,No facture,[/*INVOICE.IDINVOICE*/],20.0.580,0,,);\
(date,DATEINVOICE,Date facture,[/*INVOICE.DATEINVOICE*/],10.0.580,1,YYYY-MM-DD);\
(date,DATEPAYMENT,Date paiement,[/*INVOICE.DATEPAYMENT*/],10.0.580,1,YYYY-MM-DD);\
(int,DISCOUNT,Remise(%),[/*INVOICE.DISCOUNT*/],3.0.580,1,,);\
)*/}'\
"Update DELIVERY set\
  IdInvoice='[/*IDINVOICE*/]',\
  DateInvoice=[/*DATEINVOICE*/],\
  DatePayment=[/*DATEPAYMENT*/],\
  Discount=[/*DISCOUNT*/]\
 where IdDelivery='[/*INVOICE.IDDELIVERY*/]'"

